Root discovery tool; no upstream dependencies. query, date_min, date_max are USER-supplied (use AND keyword logic, no search operators). This is the mandatory first step to obtain email_id values before delete_email, reply_email, or forward_email. Note it may return the literal string 'No emails found.' rather than a list.
